00:02:07.920 --> 00:02:10.399
monolithic repository that evolved over

00:02:10.399 --> 00:02:13.760
a decade and at some point realized that

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:15.120
that wasn't going to scale with the

00:02:15.120 --> 00:02:18.206
