00:02:18.206 --> 00:02:20.000
[snorts] went into microservices and

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:23.599
micro libraries and the number of

00:02:23.599 --> 00:02:28.160
exploded and I was working on uh a team

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:30.160
