00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:42.640
on it. So the all repos tool, the public

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:46.480
one is sort of a re-imagination of a

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:49.920
private tool also by the same name at

00:02:49.920 --> 00:02:52.000
>> And if I for example maintain 20

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:53.920
different projects, what are my options?

00:02:53.920 --> 00:02:57.120
