are there any other tools that you would

00:02:58.720 --> 00:02:59.599
also recommend?

00:02:59.599 --> 00:03:01.519
>> So there's a few other tools in this

00:03:01.519 --> 00:03:03.760
space. Um I think there's like a shell

00:03:03.760 --> 00:03:06.080
script that some people use to just

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:07.599
clone everything. Um, but the cool thing

00:03:07.599 --> 00:03:09.760
