00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:33.519
>> And you're also the creator of

00:03:33.519 --> 00:03:34.799
pre-comit, right?

00:03:34.799 --> 00:03:37.840
>> That's me. How did you get started?

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:40.080
>> Ah, this is actually a fun story. So,

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:44.480
the first version of pre-commit was a

00:03:44.480 --> 00:03:48.239
thousandline Python script in my group

00:03:48.239 --> 00:03:51.680
projects in college because I wanted to

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:53.599
enforce standards on my group partner

00:03:53.599 --> 00:03:56.799
mates and they weren't playing ball. So,

00:03:56.799 --> 00:04:00.480
