00:06:13.919 --> 00:06:16.240
>> I have found so many bugs in so many

00:06:16.240 --> 00:06:17.840
programming languages from working on

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:20.160
pre-commit and tools as well. Uh I think

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:22.000
I've reported at least four different

