00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:41.280
surprising one was a breakage in npm. Uh

00:06:41.280 --> 00:06:43.680
somehow it got through several layers of

00:06:43.680 --> 00:06:46.800
QA and released to the public and then

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:48.720
the first people to notice were somehow

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:50.960
pre-commit users because

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:52.880
>> by default it installs the latest node

