my issue tracker with why why doesn't

00:06:58.800 --> 00:07:01.919
mpm work and uh it was a fun one to

00:07:01.919 --> 00:07:04.639
biseect find the actual bug in mpm and

00:07:04.639 --> 00:07:06.400
then ultimately get it fixed.

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:08.639
>> You're also recognized as a GitHub star

00:07:08.639 --> 00:07:11.280
for open source contributions. What are

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:13.360
your thoughts about funding and open

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:14.720
source? [laughter]

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:17.280
>> This is not an official GitHub response

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:20.319
here, but um I'm unfortunately a little

00:07:20.319 --> 00:07:22.560
pessimistic about open source funding. I

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:24.960
think that there, you know, there's lots

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:27.120
of open source software and many

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:29.840
corporations derive millions or billions

