box on

00:09:21.360 --> 00:09:22.720
>> everyone is anonymous.

00:09:22.720 --> 00:09:25.040
>> Yeah. There's you [laughter]

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:26.959
>> but other people creating issues.

00:09:26.959 --> 00:09:29.600
>> Yes. Random random user 123. You have no

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:31.200
idea who they are. You don't know their

