going through right now. Like maybe

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:34.959
they're going through a breakup. Maybe

00:09:34.959 --> 00:09:36.959
they're having a hard time at work.

00:09:36.959 --> 00:09:38.640
Maybe they're just frustrated because

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:39.920
they've been trying to get this thing

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:41.920
working for 6 hours and this tool just

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:45.440
isn't doing what I expect it to. And you

00:09:45.440 --> 00:09:48.240
know, I I'm I'm not [laughter] guiltless

