in this as well. Like there's certainly

00:09:49.760 --> 00:09:52.080
some aspect of, you know, I'm busy with

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:53.839
with day-to-day life. You know,

00:09:53.839 --> 00:09:55.360
sometimes you can be short. Sometimes

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:56.720
you just need to close the issue and

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:59.519
walk away from the computer. And uh

00:09:59.519 --> 00:10:02.640
yeah, you know, open source is not

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:05.760
always sunshine and rainbows or fun.

00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:08.800
Yes. Honestly,

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:11.120
h that's tough because I think if I went

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:12.560
back in time, I would probably tell

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:15.519
myself, hey, maybe spend more free time

