not maintaining more projects so that

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:21.760
you can have a more balanced life. And

00:10:21.760 --> 00:10:23.279
is this something that came over time

00:10:23.279 --> 00:10:25.120
that you don't take those comments

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:27.440
personally or this is something that was

00:10:27.440 --> 00:10:29.600
always there because lots of people feel

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:31.680
