00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.639
bugs and seeing whether they still

00:12:50.639 --> 00:12:53.760
reproduce is a very valuable piece of of

00:12:53.760 --> 00:12:55.600
uh maintenance that often is

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:58.079
underappreciated or or overlooked.

